{"id":"659363","name":"荷叶蒸鸡","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659363/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土鸡","amount":"半只"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"50g"},{"name":"虫草花","amount":"15g"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"8颗"},{"name":"姜丝","amount":"10g"},{"name":"葱","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"半只鸡。","img":"images/659363/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剁成块。","img":"images/659363/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备香菇、虫草花、红枣。","img":"images/659363/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜丝、葱适量。","img":"images/659363/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把所有食材倒一起。","img":"images/659363/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入盐、酱油、蚝油、胡椒粉、生粉抓拌均匀，最后淋入花生油锁住水分，腌制时间为半小时。","img":"images/659363/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"荷叶放锅里煮10分钟，把叶子煮软，并起到高温消毒的作用。","img":"images/659363/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把荷叶张开。","img":"images/659363/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把腌制好的鸡肉放入荷叶里。","img":"images/659363/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包裹起来，入蒸锅。","img":"images/659363/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"蒸30分钟。","img":"images/659363/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到。","img":"images/659363/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。荷叶蒸鸡，鲜香嫩滑，还带有荷叶的清香。","img":"images/659363/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}